WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.027
Welcome to your Webinar System. This short video shows you exactly what to do at each of the seven steps. You do not need to finish in one sitting. Everything saves as you go, and you can skip anything and come back to it.

00:00:12.177 --> 00:00:25.163
Step one is your webinar. You get one question per screen. Type your answer, or press the microphone and just say it. Under every question is the reason we ask, and an example. Press next to move on, or skip for now if you are not sure.

00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:36.764
You will tell us what the webinar is called, who presents it, whether it is live or pre recorded, and when it runs. If you have not picked a date yet, skip it. We count your reminders back from this date later.

00:00:36.914 --> 00:00:51.778
Step two is your audience. Tell us who the webinar is for, what frustrates them, what they want instead, and why they hesitate. Add one line at a time, and use the words your clients actually use. These become the headlines on your page, and the opening lines of your ads.

00:00:51.928 --> 00:01:05.491
At the end of each step you can go deeper with a ready made questionnaire. Answer it on the page, open your own copy in Google Docs, or drag in a document you already have. None of it is required, but the more we know, the better everything reads.

00:01:05.641 --> 00:01:16.067
Inside a questionnaire, every answer saves as you type, and every box has a microphone. If you fill in the Google Docs copy instead, paste its link back here so we can read it.

00:01:16.217 --> 00:01:29.716
Step three is your offer and your proof. Tell us what you sell, what it costs, and how people buy. Then tell us about three clients you have helped. Only tick the permission box if that client has agreed. We never use a name or a result without it.

00:01:29.866 --> 00:01:43.813
Step four connects your tools. For each one, pick the tool you use. You then see numbered instructions for that tool only, a button that opens the right page, and a box to paste into. Press check connection, and it tells you in plain words whether it worked.

00:01:43.963 --> 00:01:57.141
You do this for your webinar platform, your contacts, your pages, your emails and texts, your booking calendar, your payments, and your ads. If you do not use something, say so and move on. Nothing breaks. That number will simply say not known.

00:01:57.291 --> 00:02:07.633
Then press test every connection. It checks each tool properly, and tells you what to fix. After that, send yourself a test sign up, to watch one person go all the way through.

00:02:07.783 --> 00:02:20.364
Step five is your look. Click the style that feels most like you, choose your brand colour, your lettering, and the shape of your buttons. A preview at the bottom shows them together. You can change any of it later without touching the words.

00:02:20.514 --> 00:02:33.394
Step six is the build. This is a list of every piece being made for you. Your pages, your videos, your emails, your texts, and your ads. When a line says ready for you to check, open it. Then press looks good, or say what you want changed.

00:02:33.544 --> 00:02:45.912
Step seven is go live. Run the connection test one last time. Then go through your own webinar as if you were a stranger, and tick each line as it works. When every line is ticked, you are ready to send people to it.

00:02:46.062 --> 00:02:56.211
Once people are signing up, open results. It follows every person from sign up to sale, names the step where you are losing the most people, and tells you what to fix first.

00:02:56.361 --> 00:03:04.847
That is the whole process. Answer the questions, connect your tools, check what gets built, and go live. Start with step one whenever you are ready.
